---
// The real and smoke namespaces under one DTB_ROOT.
---

<figure class="fig">
            <div style="border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--card); padding: 20px; min-width: 0">
              <div style="border: 1px solid var(--ink); padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 14px; min-width: 0">
                <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 12px"><code style="font: 500 13px/1.3 var(--mono)">$DTB_ROOT/</code><span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--muted)">shared by every namespace</span></div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px"><code style="font: 500 12px/1 var(--mono); padding: 6px 8px; background: var(--tint)">weights/</code><code style="font: 500 12px/1 var(--mono); padding: 6px 8px; background: var(--tint)">upstream/</code><code style="font: 500 12px/1 var(--mono); padding: 6px 8px; background: var(--tint)">hf/</code><code style="font: 500 12px/1 var(--mono); padding: 6px 8px; background: var(--tint)">parity/envs/</code></div>
                <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: var(--f-two); gap: 12px">
                  <div style="border: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 12px; display: grid; gap: 10px; align-content: start; min-width: 0">
                    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 10px"><strong style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem">Real runs</strong><span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--muted)">at the root</span></div>
                    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px"><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2)">datasets/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2)">manifests/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2)">faces/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2)">scores/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2)">results/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2)">splits/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid var(--rule-2)">parity/&lt;model&gt;/</code></div>
                    <span style="font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted)">The only runs <code>--publish</code> accepts.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div style="border: 1px dashed var(--muted); padding: 12px; display: grid; gap: 10px; align-content: start; min-width: 0; background: var(--paper)">
                    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 10px"><code style="font: 600 13px/1.3 var(--mono)">smoke/</code><span style="font: 500 11.5px/1.4 var(--mono); color: var(--accent-ink)">DTB_NAMESPACE=smoke</span></div>
                    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px"><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px dashed var(--rule-3)">datasets/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px dashed var(--rule-3)">manifests/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px dashed var(--rule-3)">faces/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px dashed var(--rule-3)">scores/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px dashed var(--rule-3)">results/</code><code style="font: 400 11.5px/1 var(--mono); padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px dashed var(--rule-3)">reports/</code></div>
                    <span style="font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--muted)">Never reported, safe to delete. Set by <code>smoke.py</code>, <code>--sample</code> and <code>--smoke</code>, never in <code>.env</code>.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <figcaption><strong>Two namespaces, one set of weights.</strong> Item-level folders move under <code>smoke/</code>; weights and upstream archives stay at the root, so a smoke run never downloads a model twice.</figcaption>
          </figure>
